# Git remotes

## Canonical repo

- **Primary remote:** `origin` → `https://github.com/uaetrail/main.git`
- **Default branch:** `main`
- **Always push commits and PRs to `origin` (`uaetrail/main`).**

## Mirror (only when asked)

- **Mirror remote:** `purchasync` → `https://github.com/rajpurchasync/UAEtrail.git`
- Push to `purchasync` **only when the user explicitly requests** mirroring to purchasync/UAEtrail.
- Do not push to `purchasync` after ordinary commits unless asked.

## Commands

```bash
# Normal push (default)
git push origin main

# Mirror (user-requested only)
git push purchasync main
```
